.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.DS_Store
.env
.env.swp
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
_docs
data/tmp/
.tmp/
.positai
# microsoft office temp/lock files
~$*
# transient render/upload logs dropped at the repo root by quarto render and the
# release upload; the deliberately archived sync logs live in data/logs/
/*.log
# quarto render artifacts left beside the .qmd at the repo root — the published
# copies live under _output/ (e.g. _output/release_database_files/)
/*_files/

# generated NetCDF publish artifacts (170MB+); published to GCS, not tracked here
data/netcdf/

# generated Darwin Core Archives (the ichthyo zip alone is 46MB); uploaded to the
# OBIS-USA IPT by hand, never tracked here. The manifests beside them ARE the record
# of what was uploaded, and are small — but they are per-machine build output too,
# so distribution.csv stays the durable record of a published OBIS dataset.
data/darwincore/
data/darwincore-staging/

# quarto leaves this behind when a render dies mid-way
*.rmarkdown

# Claude Code per-machine settings (paths are local to one machine)
.claude/settings.local.json
